[[Kurzick Guard]]s appear in most [[outpost]]s and [[explorable area]]s in [[Echovald Forest]] and [[the Jade Sea]]. They will appear in outposts only if that outpost is under control of the [[Kurzick]]s, and will similarly appear by [[Resurrection Shrine]]s if that shrine is behind the [[Kurzick-Luxon border|Kurzick border]].

